: 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I downloaded mavsdk-windows-x64-release v1.4.3 for mavsdk_server and realized the .proto files need to be retrieved separately from a different repository. This also seems to apply to the .deb and .rpm releases. Since mavsdk_server is a gRPC server and a client cannot interact with it without the schema, it would be great to have the .proto files available as part of the release.\r\n\r\nIn this case I just wanted to try the server with [grpcui](https://github.com/fullstorydev/grpcui), but there are other use cases like running similar tools (gRPCurl, ghz, etc.) or generating code for a language that is not supported yet.\r\n\r\nOn a side note, it would also help to somehow note the version / commit hash of the MAVSDK-Proto repository used in the release.\r\n\r\nThanks!", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1833/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1833/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1172573277", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1833#issuecomment-1172573277", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1833", "id": 1172573277, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s5F5Axd", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2022-07-01T17:38:33Z", "updated_at": "2022-07-01T17:38:33Z", "body": "> it would be great to have the .proto files available as part of the release\r\n\r\nI agree, that's a very fair point! Would you be willing to contribute that for the Windows package? I guess it would need to be done from the [Windows job](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/blob/main/.github/workflows/main.yml#L631) in the CI.\r\n\r\n> On a side note, it w